description: Rules for Blade templates and server-rendered pages.
globs: ["resources/views/**/*.blade.php"]
alwaysApply: true

# Blade Structure
- Keep views focused and small; extract partials/components for repeated UI.
- Use @include / @component / @extends consistently; avoid huge monolithic templates.
- No heavy business logic in Blade; only simple presentation logic.
- Escape output by default; only use `{!! !!}` when content is known-safe.

# Assets & Vite
- Reference assets through Vite helpers (@vite) where applicable.
- Keep inline <script> and <style> minimal; prefer external JS/CSS via Vite.

# Accessibility & SEO
- Use semantic HTML (landmarks, headings, labels).
- Provide alt text for images; proper form labels and aria attributes.
